{"words": [{"text": "بَلَىٰ", "translation": "Yes"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "whoever"}, {"text": "كَسَبَ", "translation": "earned"}, {"text": "سَيِّئَةًۭ", "translation": "evil"}, {"text": "وَأَحَـٰطَتْ", "translation": "and surrounded him"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "translation": "with"}, {"text": "خَطِيٓـَٔتُهُۥ", "translation": "his sins "}, {"text": "فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "[so] those"}, {"text": "أَصْحَـٰبُ", "translation": "(are the) companions"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارِ ۖ", "translation": "(of) the Fire"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "خَـٰلِدُونَ", "translation": "(will) abide forever"}], "sahih": "Yes, [on the contrary], whoever earns evil and his sin has encompassed him - those are the companions of the Fire; they will abide therein eternally."}